<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8300.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8300.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8300 against the dollar, up from 2.8360 on Friday and at 1.8395 against the mark, down from 1.8390, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
